%define anolis_release 1
%global         rustflags -C opt-level=3 -C codegen-units=1
%global         debug_package %{nil}

Name:           skillfs
Version:        @VERSION@
Release:        %{anolis_release}%{?dist}
Summary:        AI agent skill management via virtual filesystem

License:        Apache-2.0
URL:            https://github.com/alibaba/anolisa
Source0:        %{name}-%{version}.tar.gz
Source1:        %{name}-%{version}-vendor.tar.gz

# Cargo.toml specifies rust-version = "1.86", edition = "2024".
BuildRequires:  rust >= 1.86
BuildRequires:  cargo
# Required by Rust crates with C build scripts and fuser/libfuse bindings.
BuildRequires:  gcc
BuildRequires:  make
BuildRequires:  pkgconfig(fuse3)

Requires:       %{name}-core = %{version}-%{release}
Requires:       %{name}-skills = %{version}-%{release}
Provides:       anolisa-component(skillfs)

%description
Compatibility package selecting matching SkillFS core and skills packages
through exact-version dependencies, without a runtime payload of its own.

%package core
Summary:        SkillFS filesystem and CLI
Requires:       fuse3
Requires:       fuse3-libs%{?_isa}
Conflicts:      %{name} < %{version}
Conflicts:      anolisa < 0.3.21

%description core
SkillFS is a FUSE-based filesystem that exposes AI agent skills through
filesystem views, while preserving ordinary POSIX passthrough behavior and
SkillFS-specific security boundaries.

%package skills
Summary:        SkillFS mount skill
Requires:       %{name}-core = %{version}-%{release}
Conflicts:      %{name} < %{version}

%description skills
Bundled skill documentation and resources for mounting SkillFS.

%prep
%setup -q -a 1 -n %{name}-%{version}

%build
export RUSTFLAGS="%{rustflags}"
cargo build --release --workspace --locked --offline

%install
rm -rf %{buildroot}

install -d -m 0755 %{buildroot}%{_bindir}
install -p -m 0755 target/release/skillfs %{buildroot}%{_bindir}/skillfs

install -d -m 0755 %{buildroot}%{_datadir}/anolisa/skills/skillfs-mount
cp -rp docs/skills/skillfs-mount/. \
    %{buildroot}%{_datadir}/anolisa/skills/skillfs-mount/

%files

%files core
%license LICENSE
%doc README.md CHANGELOG.md
%attr(0755,root,root) %{_bindir}/skillfs

%files skills
%dir %{_datadir}/anolisa/skills
%{_datadir}/anolisa/skills/skillfs-mount/

%changelog
* Wed Oct 28 2026 kongche-jbw <kongche.jbw@alibaba-inc.com> - 0.5.4-1
- Remove stale discovery entries after nested skill moves.
- Preserve npm install arguments and literal chat log roots.

* Fri Oct 23 2026 kongche-jbw <kongche.jbw@alibaba-inc.com> - 0.5.3-1
- Release mount startup, installation and view consistency fixes.
- Support managed configuration mounts with frozen recovery inputs.

* Thu Oct 15 2026 kongche-jbw <kongche.jbw@alibaba-inc.com> - 0.5.2-1
- Preserve live Ledger backing aliases when FUSE shutdown remains busy.
- Bound authenticated notifications with whole-skill rescan fallback.

* Sat Oct 10 2026 kongche-jbw <kongche.jbw@alibaba-inc.com> - 0.5.1-1
- Harden activation, filesystem, mount, and configuration boundaries.
- Fix watcher updates, skill parsing, and command adaptation edge cases.

* Sun Sep 20 2026 kongche-jbw <kongche.jbw@alibaba-inc.com> - 0.5.0-1
- Add multi-source mounts and read-only Ledger deployment support.
- Supervise sidecar mounts with bounded recovery retries.
- Keep transformed reads stable per open and cache results across opens.

* Thu Aug 27 2026 kongche-jbw <kongche.jbw@alibaba-inc.com> - 0.4.2-1
- Add an optional Alibaba Cloud Linux 4 sidecar image and operator guidance.
- Retry startup reconciles after transient notify daemon endpoint failures.
- Fix flat writes and renames for categorized Skill sources.

* Fri Aug 21 2026 kongche-jbw <kongche.jbw@alibaba-inc.com> - 0.4.1-1
- Add Kubernetes sidecar deployment and authenticated container peers.
- Fix nested Hermes activation and harden metadata and backing aliases.
- Tighten sidecar health recovery without restarting the workload.

* Fri Jul 24 2026 Kongche <kongche.jbw@alibaba-inc.com> - 0.4.0-1
- Release read-time OS transforms and live Skill Ledger integration.

* Thu Jul 16 2026 Kongche <kongche.jbw@alibaba-inc.com> - 0.3.4-1
- Preserve SLS ops records when CLI output pipes close early.

* Fri Jul 10 2026 Kongche <kongche.jbw@alibaba-inc.com> - 0.3.3-1
- Release Hermes workspace layout compatibility and SkillFS reliability fixes.

* Fri Jul 03 2026 Kongche <kongche.jbw@alibaba-inc.com> - 0.3.2-1
- Fix SLS ops logging and runtime metric delta reporting.

* Fri Jul 03 2026 Kongche <kongche.jbw@alibaba-inc.com> - 0.3.1-1
- Release managed mount recovery and installer hardening updates.

* Fri Jun 26 2026 Kongche <kongche.jbw@alibaba-inc.com> - 0.3.0-1
- Release SkillFS runtime security and installer compatibility updates.

* Wed Jun 24 2026 Kongche <kongche.jbw@alibaba-inc.com> - 0.2.0-1
- Package SkillFS from the ANOLISA monorepo.
